# Oildeep Gearhulk, "ward {1}": whenever it becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player
# pays {1}. Bot2's only mana is a Mox Ruby, which pays for the Lightning Bolt, so the ward trigger counters it and the Gearhulk takes no
# damage. The positive control is the neighbouring scenario, where the opponent can pay and the Bolt resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Oildeep Gearhulk
Island x2
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oildeep Gearhulk.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Oildeep Gearhulk)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

